      ],
      "content": "SP 91 SW              MARSWORTH          GRAND UNION CANAL-                                          AYLESBURY ARM (WATERY LANE) 6/107                                    Canal House - GV                                       II House, part probably a canal office.  Mid C19, altered.  Pebbledash and render, hipped slate roofs, pebbledashed chimneys with rendered cornices.  One storey and basement, front to canal of 4 bays.  Bays 1 and 3 have paired casements with cast iron lattic glazing bars, right bay has C20 barred wooden casement.  Second bay has canted projection with 2-light window to front and single lights with marginal glazing to sides.  Basement has irregular early C20 windows and lean-to.  Entry to rear, which also has 2-storey semi-circular projection and similar early C20 windows.  Included for group value. Listing NGR: SP9173914382"
    }
  ],
